<h1 class="sectionedit1"><a name="the_phpnet_wiki" id="the_phpnet_wiki">The PHP.net wiki</a></h1>
<div class="level1">

<p>
Welcome to the <acronym title="Hypertext Preprocessor">PHP</acronym> Wiki pages! This wiki is mainly used to track internal development of the <acronym title="Hypertext Preprocessor">PHP</acronym> project, so feel free to scour the wiki and join the project.
</p>

</div>

